⚠️ Today's GATE Traps

Trap 1

Bandwidth ≠ Throughput

Bandwidth is capacity; throughput is actual achieved rate.

Trap 2

Transmission delay ≠ Propagation delay

Remember:

Transmission → L/R
Propagation  → d/v

Trap 3

A router is primarily associated with the Network Layer, not Transport Layer.

Trap 4

A switch and hub are not equivalent.

Trap 5

Packet switching does not require a dedicated end-to-end physical circuit.


